  "operation": "Copy complete original minimap filter, persistent setting, entry/filter item, multi-text controller and global pointer result components. Reuse complete original tab and generic UI pool implementations and the full pinned R3 disposable bag. Replace singleton/data/pool-scope/input/persistence/resource resolution with explicit ports; adapt the two unused Unit event payloads to direct UnityEvent listeners while preserving callback registration/lifetime/order. Retain every filter selection, absent-key default, resource-layer toggle, all-table persistence update, outside-click raycast, prefab filename lookup, supporter iteration, resource caching and source null/empty behavior. The six-field configuration type is a read-only consumption projection, not a replacement binary parser.",
  "limitations": [
    "Production mainline integration of the original filter component and object pools, official full-screen map/root integration, and Windows Player remain required."
  ]
